				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "caa2aa70-4025-5102-9cb1-1c5ea3fff24b")
	)
	(text_box "IN+ = G_LA with the contract's 100 k pull-down at the input; IN- tied to GND1. Output side from the MGJ2 rails (+20 V / -5 V around LSD_0V). UVLO, unpowered input side, unbiased output: OUT held low (SLLSER8J Tables\n8-2, 8-3, §8.3.4.2).\nTurn-on: (20-9 V)/(220+3.7 Ohm) = 49 mA through the 51 nC Miller charge -> 1.0 us, about 2 V/ns at the drain [CALC]. Turn-off: 33 Ohm via 1N4148W, about 0.36 A -> 0.14 us. CLAMP pin goes straight to the gate: below\nVEE2 + 2.1 V it ties the gate to -5 V with >= 5 A.\nR1318 10 k gate-source holds QLA off with every supply absent. D1308 (22 V) + D1309 (6.8 V) anti-series clamp: +21.5..+24 V / -7.1..-7.9 V against the absolute VGS +23/-10 V (+25/-12 V transient)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 466.02 31.75 0)
		(size 247.1 12.795)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a41483ff-9232-5bcc-a1d1-704755bc96dc")
	)
