	(text_box "BTEST_EN (100 k pull-down here) -> DMN3042L -> coil from BRIDGE_5V (28 Ohm, 178 mA at 5 V), 1N4148W flyback. Cold switched: sheet 12 closes it >= 2 ms before any low side\nand only with TEST_MODE.\nAt <= 60 V: 0.29 A, 17.6 W peak, <= 0.18 J. A welded K1301 during a real shock would put about 190 J into R1303 (80 J rating): it would fail; the self-test finds a welded\ncontact (§B14.3) and the firmware refuses to shock (fault 31, open item).\nRelay operating range is -20..+70 C (narrower than the rest of the sheet) -> capture notes."
