		(uuid "e6239440-dbf3-5e5a-92f8-e769caa1aa90")
	)
	(text_box "Next to D1301's cathode and R1301. When the over-current turn-off stops the bridge current, the current in the cable to the off-board capacitor needs a path: without this capacitor\nthe switch saw 3.2-3.7 kV with 0.5-1 uH of cable (BR Q2), over its 3.3 kV rating. Two in series so one shorted part does not short the main capacitor; each 3,000 V part alone takes\n2.2 kV plus the spike.\nSimulated with this circuit (sim/rev3-wpg S-2): trip band 74-86 A, cable 0.5-1 uH -> switch 2.47-2.77 kV (>= 533 V under 3.3 kV); film <= 101 A (216 A rated), <= 673 V/us (1,440\nV/us rated). WITH THE FILM OPEN: 3.59 kV at 1 uH, over the rating - an open film part is latent (capture notes R3.8). Standing load added to the capacitor: 20 MOhm (0.24 W at 2.2\nkV)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 862.645 420.02 0)
		(size 204.92 14.954)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19f5cc0d-2179-5a25-b3d7-c304b9e8a317")
	)
	(text_box "Rev 0.3 carrier-loss detector, HSA island (floats with HV_OUT_A): empties HSA_RECT about 1.2 us after the carrier stops"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 862.645 471.834 0)
		(size 234.36 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8e17eec7-4768-5f41-ac1d-aba59f0a8ef4")
	)
	(text_box "BR Q1 change 3 / R3 §3: a copy rectifier (BAV70) charges 47 pF while the carrier runs and holds an NPN on, which keeps the 2N7002 off. When the carrier stops, the 47 pF decays (about 0.15 us; the 0.19 us\ndead time is bridged), the NPN releases, the 2N7002 gate is pulled up from the GATE node through 10 k and C1315 is emptied through 100 Ohm, so the PNP Q1306 starts turning QHA off at once. Load on the island\nabout 3.5 mA.\nAll HSA_* nets are class HV_FLOAT (no test points, R9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 862.645 478.184 0)
		(size 234.36 10.636)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4c23c0e9-295d-54c9-bced-8c0a42331ae8")
	)
	(text_box "Rev 0.3 carrier-loss detector, HSB island (floats with HV_OUT_B): same as HSA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 290.765 486.725 0)
		(size 234.36 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1124bc56-2883-529a-b6be-0da40b0b4efa")
	)
	(text_box "Identical to the HSA detector, on T1302's secondary."
